        "english": "A crow was very thirsty."
      },
      {
        "hindi": "उसे एक घड़ा मिला।",
        "english": "He found a pot."
      },
      {
        "hindi": "घड़े में थोड़ा पानी था।",
        "english": "There was little water in the pot."
      },
